36: newChat{ id="next2",
37: 	text = _t[[During the Spellblaze the world was torn apart - literally. A part of it, that we now call the Abashed Expanse, was ripped from the world and thrown into the void between the stars.
38: We managed to stabilize it and it is now orbiting Eyal. Recently we have noticed a disturbance there; if we do nothing it will crash onto Eyal, bringing much destruction in its wake.
